All right, so the light shines in darkness and darkness comprehends it not.

233
00:17:57,240 --> 00:17:59,880
Now let me explain this to you and follow closely.

234
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:04,680
How did God create the world by His Son?

235
00:18:07,060 --> 00:18:15,220
When God said, let there be light in the sun was life and creative light.

236
00:18:15,620 --> 00:18:16,060
Come on.

237
00:18:16,060 --> 00:18:16,980
Are you listening to me?

238
00:18:17,300 --> 00:18:32,590
It was that light, the effulgence of that light that led to the creation or intimated or provoked like a spiritual reaction, the creation of every physical thing.

239
00:18:32,590 --> 00:18:36,990
This is how come we know that there was some light in Genesis 1.

240
00:18:36,990 --> 00:18:38,070
We are not sure what it was.

241
00:18:38,630 --> 00:18:41,830
It was until days after that the sun was made.

242
00:18:42,550 --> 00:18:45,790
So which light was it that God said, let there be?

243
00:18:45,790 --> 00:18:46,950
Are you getting what I'm saying?

244
00:18:47,430 --> 00:18:50,590
And these are some of the things that John 1 is now explaining to us.

245
00:18:50,590 --> 00:18:52,710
That light was Christ.

246
00:18:53,830 --> 00:18:54,390
Amen.

247
00:18:54,390 --> 00:18:54,950
Somebody.

248
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:58,480
Hold up closely now you need see.

249
00:18:58,960 --> 00:19:01,120
Just pretend you are wearing a hat and adjust it.

250
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:02,680
Put on your thinking caps.

251
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:03,280
All right, good.

252
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:14,160
This becomes the pattern in the New Testament that just the same way there was darkness, there was void in the beginning.

253
00:19:14,160 --> 00:19:15,920
And God said, let there be light.

254
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:20,560
And God in His Son created everything physical that we see.

255
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:23,920
The Bible says all things were made by him, through him and for Him.

256
00:19:23,920 --> 00:19:24,960
You believe that, don't you?

257
00:19:26,870 --> 00:19:30,070
Now there is also spiritual darkness.

258
00:19:31,430 --> 00:19:45,830
And the same way God sent His Son to give us light in salvation, so that the same way the void and the darkness in the beginning was corrected by the activities of His Son.

259
00:19:46,150 --> 00:19:51,830
That spiritual darkness will also be dealt with by the salvation in His Son.

260
00:19:52,040 --> 00:19:54,120
If you understand what I just said say loud amen.

